{
  "_readme": "What scripts/wipe-user-data.mjs keeps and erases (Majed 2026-10-11: erase all the data collected from users, keep the menu, courts and the rest of the setup). Every table in schemas public and app is listed exactly once; the script refuses to run while any table is missing, so a new migration's table must be placed here first. Exceptions inside a wiped table: profiles of staff and coaches stay (a coach row needs its profile), and so do their logins. Links from kept rows to wiped rows are cleared first (links_cleared). Storage: menu-media stays whole (menu, hero and coach photos); avatars keeps only kept profiles' photos; staff-media is emptied. The assistant's index loses the chunks made from wiped tables (chunk_kinds_wiped).",
